Subject: [PATCH 008/136] FROMGIT ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,sm8250: Add Motorola
 Edge 30 sound card

Document the bindings for the sound card on motorola-dubai which uses the
Elite DSP architecture.

Signed-off-by: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261016073157.611956-4-val@packett.cool
Signed-off-by: Mark Brown <broonie@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Marcus Ramberg <marcus@means.no>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
index 1536fcd96d68..d60e0ca4ccf3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ properties:
           - ayaneo,pocket-s2-sndcard
           - fairphone,fp4-sndcard
           - fairphone,fp5-sndcard
+          - motorola,dubai-sndcard
           - qcom,apq8096-sndcard
           - qcom,glymur-sndcard
           - qcom,qcm6490-idp-sndcard
